   ["Class 5", "2 in (Xtra Duty) or 2-1/2 in (Commercial)", "16,000–17,000 / 2,400–2,550 lb; 18,000–20,000 / 2,700 lb", "10,000–25,000 / 1,000–4,000 lb (2, 2-1/2 or 3 in)", "Heavy-duty and commercial trucks"],
