  {"h": "Ignoring tongue weight", "body": "A trailer inside the GTW can still overload the hitch or the vehicle's tongue limit. Aim for 10–15% and check it against both ratings."},
  {"h": "Running a 2 in rack on an adapted 1-1/4 in hitch", "body": "CURT says the adapter can halve tongue-weight capacity. A loaded rack can exceed what is left."},
  {"h": "Towing a braked trailer without a controller", "body": "The 7-way plug only carries the signal. Without a brake controller in the cab, the trailer's brakes never engage."},
